OL,3,GNEWSAPetrol bombs thrown at police in
OL,4,ALondonderry
OL,5,
OL,6,FPetrol bombs have been thrown at police
OL,7,Fas they dealt with "sporadic disorder"
OL,8,Fin the Waterside area of Londonderry.
OL,10,FPolice said fireworks were also let off
OL,11,Fin the area of Strabane Old Road on
OL,12,FSunday evening.
OL,14,FThey said they are working to bring the
OL,15,Fsituation under control, and road users
OL,16,Fare asked to avoid the area.
OL,18,FAn update will be provided in due
OL,19,Fcourse, police added.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
